#. External Services section heading
msgid "External Services"
msgstr "外部服务"

#. External Services intro
msgid "This plugin connects to two third-party services, both **opt-in via explicit user action**. No visitor data is ever sent to either service."
msgstr "本插件会连接两个第三方服务，两者均**需要由用户明确操作后才会启用**。任何情况下都不会向这两个服务发送访客数据。"

#. MaxMind section heading
msgid "MaxMind GeoLite2 (optional)"
msgstr "MaxMind GeoLite2（可选）"

#. MaxMind description
msgid "Used to download the MaxMind GeoLite2-City database for high-accuracy visitor geolocation. Requires a free MaxMind account and a license key the user pastes into Settings → GeoIP. Accuracy: approximate city/region only — not for identifying individuals or households."
msgstr "用于下载 MaxMind GeoLite2-City 数据库，以提供较高精度的访客地理定位。需要一个免费的 MaxMind 账号，以及用户在“设置 → GeoIP”中粘贴的许可密钥。精度：仅为近似的城市/地区级别，不可用于识别个人或家庭。"

#. MaxMind bullet: source
msgid "Source: MaxMind (https://www.maxmind.com), downloaded from https://download.maxmind.com/app/geoip_download"
msgstr "来源：MaxMind（https://www.maxmind.com），下载地址为 https://download.maxmind.com/app/geoip_download"

#. MaxMind bullet: when
msgid "When: Weekly via WP-Cron, only after the user enables GeoIP and configures a license key"
msgstr "时间：在用户启用 GeoIP 并配置许可密钥后，通过 WP-Cron 每周下载一次"

#. MaxMind bullet: data sent
msgid "Data sent: License key + standard HTTP request headers. No visitor data is transmitted."
msgstr "发送的数据：许可密钥与标准 HTTP 请求头。不会传输任何访客数据。"

#. MaxMind bullet: data received
msgid "Data received: GeoLite2-City.mmdb file, stored in your `wp-content/uploads/statnive/` directory"
msgstr "接收的数据：GeoLite2-City.mmdb 文件，存储在您的 `wp-content/uploads/statnive/` 目录中"

#. MaxMind bullet: purpose
msgid "Purpose: Approximate visitor geolocation (country / region / coarse city)"
msgstr "用途：近似的访客地理定位（国家/地区 / 地区 / 大致城市）"

#. MaxMind bullet: signup
msgid "Sign up for a MaxMind account: https://www.maxmind.com/en/geolite2/signup"
msgstr "注册 MaxMind 账号：https://www.maxmind.com/en/geolite2/signup"

#. MaxMind bullet: license key
msgid "Get your license key: https://www.maxmind.com/en/accounts/current/license-key"
msgstr "获取您的许可密钥：https://www.maxmind.com/en/accounts/current/license-key"

#. MaxMind bullet: privacy
msgid "MaxMind Privacy Policy: https://www.maxmind.com/en/privacy-policy"
msgstr "MaxMind 隐私政策：https://www.maxmind.com/en/privacy-policy"

#. MaxMind bullet: terms
msgid "MaxMind Terms of Use: https://www.maxmind.com/en/terms-of-use"
msgstr "MaxMind 使用条款：https://www.maxmind.com/en/terms-of-use"

#. MaxMind bullet: EULA
msgid "MaxMind GeoLite2 EULA: https://www.maxmind.com/en/geolite2/eula"
msgstr "MaxMind GeoLite2 EULA：https://www.maxmind.com/en/geolite2/eula"

#. MaxMind attribution
msgid "This product includes GeoLite Data created by MaxMind, available from https://www.maxmind.com."
msgstr "本产品包含由 MaxMind 创建的 GeoLite 数据，可在 https://www.maxmind.com 获取。"

#. DB-IP section heading
msgid "DB-IP IP-to-City Lite (optional)"
msgstr "DB-IP IP-to-City Lite（可选）"

#. DB-IP description
msgid "Used to download the free DB-IP IP-to-City Lite database. No account, no license key, no EULA. Accuracy: approximate city/region only — not for identifying individuals or households."
msgstr "用于下载免费的 DB-IP IP-to-City Lite 数据库。无需账号、无需许可密钥、无需 EULA。精度：仅为近似的城市/地区级别，不可用于识别个人或家庭。"

#. DB-IP bullet: source
msgid "Source: DB-IP (https://db-ip.com), downloaded from https://download.db-ip.com/free/"
msgstr "来源：DB-IP（https://db-ip.com），下载地址为 https://download.db-ip.com/free/"

#. DB-IP bullet: when
msgid "When: One-shot user click \"Enable city-level geography\" on the Geography page, then monthly via WP-Cron for refresh"
msgstr "时间：用户在“地理位置”页面一键点击“启用城市级地理位置”后下载一次，之后通过 WP-Cron 每月刷新一次"

#. DB-IP bullet: data sent
msgid "Data sent: Standard HTTP request headers only (no visitor data, no account, no key)"
msgstr "发送的数据：仅标准 HTTP 请求头（不发送访客数据、不使用账号、不使用密钥）"

#. DB-IP bullet: data received
msgid "Data received: dbip-city-lite-YYYY-MM.mmdb.gz file, decompressed to your `wp-content/uploads/statnive/` directory"
msgstr "接收的数据：dbip-city-lite-YYYY-MM.mmdb.gz 文件，解压后存储到您的 `wp-content/uploads/statnive/` 目录中"

#. DB-IP bullet: purpose
msgid "Purpose: Approximate visitor geolocation (city / region / country)"
msgstr "用途：近似的访客地理定位（城市 / 地区 / 国家）"

#. DB-IP bullet: terms
msgid "DB-IP Terms: https://db-ip.com/tos.php"
msgstr "DB-IP 服务条款：https://db-ip.com/tos.php"

#. DB-IP bullet: privacy
msgid "DB-IP Privacy Policy: https://db-ip.com/privacy.php"
msgstr "DB-IP 隐私政策：https://db-ip.com/privacy.php"

#. DB-IP bullet: license
msgid "License: CC-BY 4.0"
msgstr "许可证：CC-BY 4.0"

#. DB-IP attribution
msgid "GeoIP data © DB-IP under CC-BY 4.0."
msgstr "GeoIP 数据 © DB-IP，依据 CC-BY 4.0 许可协议。"

#. External Services outro
msgid "No visitor data is ever sent to any external service. All analytics data remains in your WordPress database."
msgstr "任何情况下都不会向任何外部服务发送访客数据。所有网站分析数据均保留在您的 WordPress 数据库中。"

#. Privacy Policy section heading
msgid "Privacy Policy"
msgstr "隐私政策"

#. Privacy Policy body
msgid "All analytics data stays in your WordPress database. Raw IPs are used only for the optional GeoIP lookup and are never persisted. Statnive registers with the WordPress Privacy API for personal-data export and erasure."
msgstr "所有网站分析数据均保留在您的 WordPress 数据库中。原始 IP 仅用于可选的 GeoIP 查询，绝不会被持久化存储。Statnive 已向 WordPress Privacy API 注册，用于个人数据的导出与删除。"

#. Changelog section heading
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "更新日志"

#. Upgrade Notice section heading
msgid "Upgrade Notice"
msgstr "升级提示"

#. Upgrade Notice 0.4.7 body
msgid "First public release on WordPress.org."
msgstr "在 WordPress.org 上的首个公开发布版本。"
